+# The former `lexyacc_remote` toolchain hard-coded
+# /usr/local/opt/{flex,bison}/bin, which does not exist on Apple Silicon and
+# is also stale on Intel (flex is not keg-only there, bison is). The
+# toolchain now comes from the `local_lexyacc` repository, which resolves
+# the binaries on the build host's PATH; see lexyacc.bzl.
